msgid "有界 I/O 生命周期属性矩阵"
msgstr "Bounded I/O lifecycle property matrix"

msgid "唯一执行链路"
msgstr "One execution chain"

msgid "执行既有命令："
msgstr "Run the maintained command:"

msgid ""
"原有 runner 完成全部 discovery 和无过滤执行，保存命令、退出码和 fresh XML。 audit "
"再检查输入未改变，discovery、XML 与 execution summary 的 case identity "
"完全一致，并确认每个索引属性确实完成。提交门禁要求整个 CMake Google plan 执行完成，不能使用 "
"`allow_subset`。成功后才生成："
msgstr ""
"The existing runner performs complete discovery and unfiltered execution, "
"retaining commands, return codes and fresh XML. Audit rechecks that inputs "
"are unchanged, that discovery, XML and execution-summary case identities "
"match exactly, and that every indexed property completed. The commit gate "
"requires the entire CMake Google plan to finish and cannot use "
"`allow_subset`. Only success produces:"

msgid "`build/<preset>/tdd/io-property-inputs.json`：执行前输入身份。"
msgstr ""
"`build/<preset>/tdd/io-property-inputs.json`: pre-execution input "
"identities."

msgid "`build/<preset>/tdd/execution.json`：唯一 runner 的实际全部执行结果。"
msgstr ""
"`build/<preset>/tdd/execution.json`: the sole runner's actual complete "
"execution results."

msgid "`build/<preset>/tdd/io-property-report.json`：绑定上述实际结果的有限属性。"
msgstr ""
"`build/<preset>/tdd/io-property-report.json`: finite properties bound to "
"those actual results."

msgid ""
"新一轮开始会删除旧 summary 和属性报告；失败不会留下上一轮成功报告。 实际执行成功而 audit 失败时，保留原始 execution "
"供定位，但不生成合格属性报告。"
msgstr ""
"A new round deletes old summaries and property reports; failures cannot "
"leave previous success reports. If execution succeeds but audit fails, raw "
"execution remains for diagnosis but no qualified property report is "
"generated."

msgid "属性边界"
msgstr "Property boundaries"

msgid ""
"断言 anchor 只用于可审查的源码导航。工具排除注释、字符串和其他 case 中的 同名断言，不能自动证明断言的逻辑意义。模型必须真实执行生产 "
"provider； 硬件依赖被显式模拟，模型结果不能提升为实板波形、电气或物理时序资格。"
msgstr ""
"Assertion anchors provide reviewable source navigation only. The tool "
"excludes comments, strings and same-named assertions in other cases but "
"cannot automatically prove an assertion's logical meaning. Models must "
"execute actual production providers; hardware dependencies are explicitly "
"modeled, and model results cannot establish board waveform, electrical or "
"physical timing qualification."

msgid ""
"当前重点包括 admission 无残留、epoch/取消、loan 保留、停失败隔离与重试、 最终 IRQ/DMA "
"撤销、迟到错误、计数/loss、FIFO/LIFO 流贷款、有限 deadline、 "
"连续接收替换地址和资源枯竭。它不是所有寄存器组合、所有控制器、所有事件 交错或形式化证明。新增属性包括 CAN "
"abort/domain/loss、USB FIFO/clock/ SETUP epoch、Ethernet descriptor/held RX "
"token，以及 generated factory 的 失败清理、foreign cold 拒绝、权限和 timer 输出 readback "
"顺序。GPIO/Flash/ 基本 PWM/watchdog 等其他 suite 不从本矩阵推导覆盖。完整未证明范围列在 catalogue 的 "
"`unproven` 中。"
msgstr ""
"Current focus includes residue-free admission, epochs/cancellation, loan "
"retention, quarantine/retry after failed stop, final IRQ/DMA withdrawal, "
"late errors, counts/loss, FIFO/LIFO stream loans, finite deadlines, "
"continuous-receive target replacement and resource exhaustion. This is "
"neither all register combinations, all controllers, all event interleavings "
"nor formal proof. Added properties include CAN abort/domain/loss, USB "
"FIFO/clock/SETUP epochs, Ethernet descriptors/held RX tokens, and generated-"
"factory failure cleanup, foreign-cold rejection, permissions and timer-"
"output readback order. Other GPIO/Flash/basic PWM/watchdog suites derive no "
"coverage from this matrix. The catalogue's `unproven` field lists the "
"complete unproved scope."

msgid ""
"factory 属性真实调用当前生成入口；模型只替代外部 CPU/MMIO 端口。部分 assertion 使用 fixture 的窄 "
"`Initialize` 或已声明 provider 宏，审查必须沿 该 fixture 的定义确认实际生产入口，不能把任意 helper "
"名称解释为生产证明。 断言导航绑定整个源码和已编译上下文，仍不自动分析条件编译内每条断言的 可达性。各目标仅建立其实际选择编译分支的有限行为。"
msgstr ""
"Factory properties actually call current generated entries; models replace "
"only external CPU/MMIO ports. Some assertions use a fixture's narrow "
"`Initialize` or declared provider macros. Review must follow fixture "
"definitions to confirm the real production entry rather than interpret "
"arbitrary helper names as production proof. Assertion navigation binds whole"
" sources and compiled contexts but does not automatically analyze "
"reachability of every assertion under conditional compilation. Each target "
"establishes finite behavior only for its actually selected branch."

msgid ""
"捕获的是列出的 TU、所选 target 的本地 TU、模型和合同以及实际命令/对象， 不宣称自动分析完整头文件 依赖闭包或验证机器码语义。clean-"
"source SDK、候选源闭包、离线重现和实板 仍由各自交付门禁建立。属性报告明确 `formal_proof=false` 和 "
"`hardware_status=not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"Capture covers listed TUs, selected targets' local TUs, models, contracts, "
"and actual commands/objects. It does not claim automatic analysis of the "
"complete header dependency closure or machine-code semantics. Clean-source "
"SDKs, candidate source closure, offline reproduction and physical boards "
"remain established by their respective delivery gates. Property reports "
"explicitly state `formal_proof=false` and `hardware_status=not_executed`."

msgid ""
"开发者可用脚本的 `capture`/`audit` 子命令检查已有执行。显式 `--allow-subset` 只产生 `development-"
"subset`，用于开发定位；它不会替代 提交门禁或软件候选。脚本不运行测试，不建立第二份目标图，也不在 MCU 实例 加入 "
"instrumentation、RAM、worker 或 vtable 槽。"
msgstr ""
"Developers may use the script's `capture`/`audit` subcommands to inspect "
"existing execution. Explicit `--allow-subset` produces only `development-"
"subset` for diagnosis; it cannot replace the commit gate or a software "
"candidate. The script neither runs tests nor creates a second target graph, "
"and adds no instrumentation, RAM, worker or vtable slot to MCU instances."

msgid "`tools/testing/io_lifecycle_matrix.json` 维护 233 条经过审查的有限属性，覆盖 STM32F407/GD32F470 UART、SPI、I2C、ADC、CAN、USB、raw Ethernet、capture/ advanced timer，选定的 STM32G474 软件参考 provider/factory，以及 Native descriptor 序列和 RS485 方向适配。每条属性明确实例模式、生产 TU、寄存器模型、 真实 Google case、该 case 内的断言和生产调用、所证明的不变量与限制。 名称和测试数量不能单独建立属性成立的证据。"
msgstr "`tools/testing/io_lifecycle_matrix.json` maintains 233 reviewed finite properties covering STM32F407/GD32F470 UART, SPI, I2C, ADC, CAN, USB, raw Ethernet, capture/advanced timers, selected STM32G474 software-reference providers/factory, Native descriptor sequences and RS485 direction adaptation. Each property identifies instance mode, production TU, register model, actual Google case, assertions and production calls within that case, and the invariant and limits proved. Names and test counts alone cannot establish evidence that a property holds."

msgid "原 203 项属性和 `unproven` 定义保持不变，另追加 30 项 F407 HAL `dma-tx` 属性。既有 LL/provider 行保留各自列明的源码和模式，不按相似名称重绑到 HAL。 新增行单独绑定实际 `uart_hal.c`、共享 RX／冷态／Core、锁定的官方 UART/DMA 源码及既有 runtime、cold、generated factory case，覆盖 IRQ RX 事件／错误／loss 和 source mask、取消、 EN=0 IRQ 门禁及迟到 TE 竞态、wake、复用、冷态 lease 和双控制器隔离。 233 是导航条目数量；元数据检查或 capture 成功不表示本轮执行了全部 case， 也不表示硬件通过。实际执行仍须绑定下述完整链路。"
msgstr "The original 203 properties and `unproven` definitions remain unchanged, with 30 F407 HAL `dma-tx` properties appended. Existing LL/provider rows keep their listed sources and modes; similar names do not rebind them to HAL. New rows separately bind actual `uart_hal.c`, shared RX/cold/Core, pinned official UART/DMA sources and existing runtime, cold and generated-factory cases. They cover IRQ RX events/errors/loss and source masks, cancellation, the EN=0 IRQ gate and late-TE race, wake, reuse, cold leases and isolation between two controllers. The 233 entries are source navigation; successful metadata checks or capture do not establish that every case ran in this attempt or that hardware passed. Actual execution still requires the complete chain below."

msgid "门禁先执行 doctor 和 Native configure/compile/link preflight；失败时不进入 工具测试。工具测试后再次 configure/build 当前 CMake `nexus_google_contracts`， 随后 capture 绑定当前 catalogue、CMake executable plan、compile database、已编译对象、 各目标 binary，以及明确列出的生产/测试/模型/公共合同源码 SHA256。每个 provider 与测试 TU 必须属于指定 Google target 的真实编译上下文；共享 Core/I/O TU 保留实际库对象与命令。缺少对象或目标不能退化为源码名匹配。 capture 同时从这份实际 compile database 保存所选目标全部本地 TU 的 源码、对象和编译命令身份，包括 build 目录生成的 factory `bindings.c`。 源码必须位于当前 checkout 或当前 build，对象必须位于当前 build 的对应 target；缺失对象、symlink、越界路径或执行期间改变生成源码/对象都拒绝。 这份观察结果复用 CMake 图，不注册另一份构建图。"
msgstr "The gate first runs doctor and a Native configure/compile/link preflight; failure prevents tool-test execution. After tool tests, it configures/builds current CMake `nexus_google_contracts` again. Capture then binds the current catalogue, CMake executable plan, compilation database, compiled objects, each target binary, and explicit SHA256 identities for production/test/model/public-contract sources. Each provider and test TU must belong to its specified Google target's actual compilation context; shared Core/I/O TUs retain real library objects and commands. Missing objects or targets cannot fall back to matching source names. Capture also saves source, object and command identities for every local TU in selected targets from that actual compilation database, including generated factory `bindings.c` in the build directory. Sources must reside in the current checkout or build, and objects in the corresponding current-build target. Missing objects, symlinks, out-of-bound paths and changes to generated sources/objects during execution are rejected. This observation reuses the CMake graph rather than registering another build graph."

msgid "新增模式或修正 provider 后，应复审不变量、真实断言、模型和 limitations， 再由新的构建和执行绑定当前源码；历史测试计数和哈希不能继承为新源的资格。 原 80 项开发矩阵和原始日志保持历史字节不变；233 项必须由当前源码重新 capture/build/execute/audit，不能把旧报告的成功状态扩展到新增属性。"
msgstr "After adding modes or fixing providers, review invariants, real assertions, models and limitations, then bind current sources through fresh build and execution. Historical test counts and hashes cannot become qualification for new sources. Original 80-property development matrices and raw logs preserve their historical bytes; the 233 properties require current-source capture/build/execute/audit, never extension of old successful reports to new properties."
